# AWS-0104: the EKS module's recommended node security group rule allows egress to 0.0.0.0/0.
# Nodes need outbound HTTPS through the NAT gateway to pull images and reach AWS APIs.
# Pod-level egress is restricted by NetworkPolicies (platform/base/network-policies.yaml).
# Fix planned: VPC endpoints (ECR, S3, STS, CloudWatch) + node egress limited to the VPC CIDR.
# Owner: @andersonfesilva
AWS-0104 exp:2027-05-31
